luckyclick (1.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: Automatically enable Smart Click for recorded and loaded points
  * Fix: Wait for the click thread to stop before returning from Stop
  * Fix: Warp the X11 desktop pointer before clicking recorded positions
  * Build: Declare debhelper compatibility and Python addon dependencies
  * Build: Restrict pybuild clean to its temporary build directory

