luckyclick (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: Smart Click now correctly clicks at recorded positions
  * Fix: X11 fallback now moves cursor to recorded coordinates before clicking
  * Fix: pynput fallback now moves cursor to recorded coordinates before clicking
  * Fix: uinput device struct now properly sets absmax/absmin/absfuzz/absflat
  * Fix: Coordinate consistency between Smart Click and normal mode on HiDPI
  * Add: Smart Click mode with per-point click type support

 -- LuckyClick Team <support@luckyclick.dev>  Sun, 05 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000

luckyclick (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Full-featured auto clicker for Linux
  * Support left, right, middle, double click
  * Recording mode with drag & drop overlay
  * Global hotkeys (F4, F8)
  * Virtual mouse support (uinput)
  * System tray integration
  * Bilingual interface (Vietnamese/English)

 -- LuckyClick Team <support@luckyclick.dev>  Mon, 04 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000
